    "B72G-2GK-QD3-RMN — filtr-regulátor G1/4, 40 µm, 0,3–10 bar, bez manometru": "B72G-2GK-QD3-RMN — filter regulator G1/4, 40 µm, 0.3–10 bar, without pressure gauge",
