    "V60A511A-A213L = 5/2 G1/8 cívka/cívka (bistabilní) dle https://www.norgren.com/en/products/v60a511a-a213j (řada). Typ s pružinou ověřit v katalogu Norgren.": "V60A511A-A213L = 5/2 G1/8 solenoid/solenoid (bistable) according to https://www.norgren.com/en/products/v60a511a-a213j (series). Verify the spring-return type in the Norgren catalogue.",
